WEBVTT

00:31:28.496 --> 00:31:31.496
But during a recession, there's
a darker side to this.

00:31:32.246 --> 00:31:35.371
It really depends on who
your community is.

00:31:36.538 --> 00:31:40.413
There tends to be greater fondness
for people within one's own group

00:31:40.413 --> 00:31:44.246
and often, not always, but
often that comes at

00:31:44.246 --> 00:31:47.996
the expense of how people perceive
and treat people who are not

00:31:47.996 --> 00:31:53.663
a part of their anger. Xenophobia is
higher. Treatment of immigrants is worse.

00:31:54.288 --> 00:31:57.079
All these different manifestations
of prejudice.